  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>To check if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is transitive -</p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Here <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>13</mn></math>&nbsp;holds true</p><p>now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>13</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#10877;</mo><mn>13</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;also holds true</p><p>but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8816;</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is not transitive</p><p>Similarly, to check transitivity of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p>but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is also not transitive.</p><p>Hence neither&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;nor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is an equivalence relation</p>",
